WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:03,940
The mouse in front of me has lost its fur.

2
00:00:03,940 --> 00:00:05,260
Except for body shape

3
00:00:05,260 --> 00:00:06,940
There is also a big change in appearance

4
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:11,110
Not like an ordinary black rat

5
00:00:11,110 --> 00:00:13,790
More like the flowery rat I saw in my previous life

6
00:00:13,790 --> 00:00:21,610
This little one is on fire

7
00:00:21,610 --> 00:00:23,090
this little thing

8
00:00:23,090 --> 00:00:25,660
The blood-preserving effect is very strange

9
00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:29,640
It must have something to do with the substance in my blood

10
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:35,390
I'd have known how much it would cost to have blood syndrome.

11
00:00:35,390 --> 00:00:48,550
You can't conjure up the bar panel out of thin air.

12
00:00:48,550 --> 00:00:52,020
If you draw a few drops of blood, you will lose 0.1

13
00:00:52,020 --> 00:00:55,290
It turns out to be Physique Zero-10
